to-be-incorporated-into-paper-155 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-155 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: A stuck computation is one with no rule to fire because the thing it inspects is unknown: `f x`" (cons "with `f` a variable, `case n ...` with `n` a variable, `p @ i` with `p` a path variable and `i` a" (cons "dimension variable. It is kept as a value (a neutral) holding its parts; reduction continues" (cons "everywhere else, including inside the branches of a stuck case. When a substitution later" (cons "supplies the unknown, it fires. A neutral's type is computed from the variable at its head along" (cons "the operations applied to it, and a stuck path's endpoints are read from that type." nil))))))
